# Production Adaptive Engine activation (Part 7)
#
# Controlled via config/env — never hardcoded ON in code. Flip to "false" or
# remove a line to roll back without a code change.
#
# Stage A: Adaptive Engine runtime ON for production builds. The live app
# produces decisions + decision traces only; it never auto-executes (execution
# is the explicit `execute()` step, gated by uiExecution).
#
# Stage B: reflection ON. Historical Role 4 outcomes yield learned
# personalization signals consumed ONLY by Tier 9; no higher tier is affected.
#
# Stage C (uiExecution) is NOT activated yet. Its knob is documented in
# .env.example.
VITE_NEUROBRIDGE_ADAPTIVE_RUNTIME=true
VITE_NEUROBRIDGE_ADAPTIVE_REFLECTION=true
